Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 09:42:10 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] feat(web): split public home page and console layout
 (WEB-02/03)

- / : public home (PublicShell + HomeView), /login public
- /console/** : ConsoleShell (menu nav from route meta.menuCode + /auth/me, user, logout)
- /password-change, /forbidden keep their URLs inside ConsoleShell (logout available)
- Logout -> /, login/password-change default -> /console, logged-in /login -> /console
- JWT, /auth/me, menu permission guard and Protocol actions unchanged

